From 35c56910b1794d08f55d2df19c556b0fcdb89a1f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Wendell <wendellmcg3@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 13:13:17 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] Complete M1/M2 tooling: sources, configs, B5 ingest, B7
 tiles, status CLI

Layer 1
- pipeline/fetch/fetch_sources.py: verified direct URLs for A3 (ZORI ZIP),
  A4 (ZHVI ZIP), A5 (HUD SAFMR FY2026 revised), A6 (DTMO 2026 rate
  component breakdown); new 'browser' acquisition class validates and
  checksums files from hosts that block scripts (A6: travel.dod.mil 403);
  A7 now pulled from Freddie Mac directly (FRED drops scripted requests);
  vendor filenames so earlier hand downloads are reused, not re-pulled;
  cached files keep their earlier manifest record or file mtime;
  gzip-encoded responses decoded; CSV sanity check
- Makefile: geometry reads the zipped ZCTA shapefile directly
- config/profiles.json (A12): E-5 w/ dependents primary, O-3 w/
  dependents contrast, DoD anchor dwellings and bedroom counts
- config/classification.json (A13): fixed-break RdBu classes centred on
  the 95% target, surplus classes, LISA cluster colours
- pipeline/check_config.py: validates A12/A13 against BAH pay grades
- pipeline/tiles/build_basemap.sh (A11): pmtiles extract from the newest
  Protomaps daily build, with provenance JSON

Layer 2
- pipeline/ingest/ingest_rate_components.py (A6 -> B5): per-MHA rent and
  utilities shares from the DTMO PDF, validated against B3
- pipeline/tiles/build_mha_pmtiles.py (B6 -> B7): tippecanoe PMTiles with
  a single `mha` property for promoteId feature-state joins

Tracking
- tools/wbs.py + `make start/done/wbs-show`: one-command node status
  updates (ranges like A3-A6) that regenerate docs/WBS.md
- Makefile: fetch, check-config, components, tiles, basemap targets;
  PYTHON variable (default python3)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MrzP3DTWrpcVWuCrrFricu
