+  "rationale": "Fixed breaks rather than quantiles: the research question is whether BAH meets a fixed 95% target, and fixed breaks keep the target visible and make maps comparable across profiles. Quantile breaks would always paint the same share of MHAs red, regardless of whether any MHA misses the target.",
